sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Vendedor
    participant W as web
    participant A as API
    participant P as PostgreSQL
    participant M as MinIO
    S->>W: POST /api/v1/seller/listings/{id}/images
    W->>A: proxy + cookie + multipart
    A->>P: valida dono, estado e limite de 8 imagens
    A->>A: detecta JPEG, PNG ou WebP (≤ 5 MiB)
    A->>M: PUT listings/{listing}/{image}.{ext}
    A->>P: INSERT listing_images
    A-->>W: 201 {id, url, position}
    W-->>S: 201
    S->>W: GET /api/v1/media/{listing}/{file}
    W->>A: proxy
    A->>P: consulta content-type pelo object key
    A->>M: GET objeto
    A-->>W: stream + Cache-Control 1 dia + nosniff
    W-->>S: 200 imagem
